OL,3,AEarly results in New Zealand election
OL,4,Ashow tight race between National and
OL,5,ALabour
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarly results are showing a tight race
OL,8,Fbetween New Zealand's two main parties
OL,10,FPrime Minister Christopher Luxon and
OL,11,Fhis National-led coalition are seeking
OL,12,Fa second term
OL,14,FHis main challenger is Chris Hipkins,
OL,15,Fleader of the centre-left Labour party
OL,17,FThe country's voting system, known as
OL,18,FMixed Member Proportional, means most
OL,19,Fgovernments are coalitions
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
